Additional notice / 附加声明

This project is a static malware-detection engine. It is provided for
research, education, and defensive security use. Do not use it to develop,
distribute, or conceal malware.

本项目是静态恶意软件检测引擎，供研究、教学与防御性安全用途。请勿用于开发、
传播或隐藏恶意软件。
